  taskName: A Romantic Promise
  taskType: 0
  difficulty: 3
  isStoryEvent: 0
  rawText: No longer did the sow weep, for the ceremony of longing had long proved
    its novelty; the beauty of romance (of being a romantic) enticed no more joy.
    The blissful lonesome gave then to unvarnished sorrow, a once-promise turned
    untimely true.
  charCount: 241
